    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll die if you enter a site that you're never supposed to enter. You have to run away from the monster. This game is horror game, you go to the hell and you adventure hell</strong><br><strong>You have to survive in hell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Eternal Hell is a short horror anomaly experience (~30 minutes) inspired by liminal spaces and psychological horror walking simulators, like 'The Exit 8', 'Pools', and their virtual predecessor, 'P.T.'.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mainly a first person walking simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a normal horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO MANY SECRETS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One big secret connects all the stories. Each story will have its own secrets for you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building is filled with eerie rooms bearing traces and stories of past inhabitants on each building.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll die if you enter a site that you're never supposed to enter. You have to run away from the monster. This game is horror game, you go to the hell and you adventure hell</strong><br><strong>You have to survive in hell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Eternal Hell is a short horror anomaly experience (~30 minutes) inspired by liminal spaces and psychological horror walking simulators, like 'The Exit 8', 'Pools', and their virtual predecessor, 'P.T.'.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mainly a first person walking simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a normal horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SO MANY SECRETS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One big secret connects all the stories. Each story will have its own secrets for you to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building is filled with eerie rooms bearing traces and stories of past inhabitants on each building.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
